<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:action-result-feedback:1> <urn:usf:predicate:assistiveSemantics> "The outcome is announced through a live region, with failure announced assertively and success politely." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:action-result-feedback:1> <urn:usf:predicate:canonicalName> "action-result-feedback" <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:action-result-feedback:1> <urn:usf:predicate:focusBehaviour> "Focus is not thrown to an unrelated region when the outcome arrives." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:action-result-feedback:1> <urn:usf:predicate:keyboardBehaviour> "The outcome is reachable by keyboard from the action that produced it." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:action-result-feedback:1> <urn:usf:predicate:patternAnatomy> "A statement of the outcome." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:action-result-feedback:1> <urn:usf:predicate:patternAnatomy> "An indication that the action is in progress." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:action-result-feedback:1> <urn:usf:predicate:patternAnatomy> "For a failure, the reason and a way to proceed." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:action-result-feedback:1> <urn:usf:predicate:patternPurpose> "Make the outcome of a discrete action unambiguous, including when it fails, and say what to do next." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:action-result-feedback:1> <urn:usf:predicate:prohibitedShortcut> "Do not leave an action in progress with no terminal outcome." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:action-result-feedback:1> <urn:usf:predicate:prohibitedShortcut> "Do not report a failure without a reason." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:action-result-feedback:1> <urn:usf:predicate:prohibitedShortcut> "Do not use the same presentation for success and failure." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
