<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:action-result-feedback:1> <urn:usf:predicate:responsiveBehaviour> "The outcome remains associated with its action when the layout reflows." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:action-result-feedback:1> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:FutureUsePattern> <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
