<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:export-download:1> <urn:usf:predicate:assistiveSemantics> "Completion and failure are both announced; a delivery that only changes a visual state is silent to anyone not watching." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:export-download:1> <urn:usf:predicate:canonicalName> "export-download" <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:export-download:1> <urn:usf:predicate:focusBehaviour> "Focus remains on the action after it completes, so a second export is possible without hunting for the control." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:export-download:1> <urn:usf:predicate:keyboardBehaviour> "The action is reachable and operable by keyboard, and its accessible name says what will be produced rather than only naming the verb." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:export-download:1> <urn:usf:predicate:patternAnatomy> "A choice of form, where more than one is genuinely available." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:export-download:1> <urn:usf:predicate:patternAnatomy> "A statement of what was delivered." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:export-download:1> <urn:usf:predicate:patternAnatomy> "An action that produces and delivers the artefact." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:export-download:1> <urn:usf:predicate:patternPurpose> "Hand someone a produced artefact in a form they chose, and make clear what they received." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:export-download:1> <urn:usf:predicate:prohibitedShortcut> "Do not offer a form the producer cannot actually deliver." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:export-download:1> <urn:usf:predicate:prohibitedShortcut> "Do not report success before the artefact exists." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:export-download:1> <urn:usf:predicate:prohibitedShortcut> "Do not silently substitute a different form from the one chosen." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:export-download:1> <urn:usf:predicate:requiresInteractionState> <urn:usf:interaction-state:acted> <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:export-download:1> <urn:usf:predicate:requiresInteractionState> <urn:usf:interaction-state:acting> <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
