<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:export-download:1> <urn:usf:predicate:responsiveBehaviour> "The action remains reachable without horizontal scrolling at every supported width." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:export-download:1> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:FutureUsePattern> <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:export-download:1> <urn:usf:predicate:version> "1" <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:input-and-preview:1> <urn:usf:predicate:assistiveSemantics> "The preview is announced as a live region so a change is noticed without sight, and it carries a text alternative describing what it depicts and whether it is usable." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:input-and-preview:1> <urn:usf:predicate:canonicalName> "input-and-preview" <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:input-and-preview:1> <urn:usf:predicate:focusBehaviour> "Focus stays where the actor put it while the preview updates; a preview refresh must never steal or reset focus." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:input-and-preview:1> <urn:usf:predicate:keyboardBehaviour> "Every control is reachable and operable by keyboard alone, in the order the visual layout implies." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:input-and-preview:1> <urn:usf:predicate:patternAnatomy> "A place to describe the desired thing." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:input-and-preview:1> <urn:usf:predicate:patternAnatomy> "A rendering of the current consequence of that description." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:input-and-preview:1> <urn:usf:predicate:patternAnatomy> "A statement of whether the current consequence is usable." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:input-and-preview:1> <urn:usf:predicate:patternPurpose> "Let someone describe what they want and see the consequence continuously, so the result is understood before it is committed to." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:input-and-preview:1> <urn:usf:predicate:prohibitedShortcut> "Do not clear the description when the consequence fails; the actor loses the work that caused the failure." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:input-and-preview:1> <urn:usf:predicate:prohibitedShortcut> "Do not present a stale preview as current while a new one is being computed." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:input-and-preview:1> <urn:usf:predicate:prohibitedShortcut> "Do not require a submit step to see the consequence; that turns a preview into a result." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:input-and-preview:1> <urn:usf:predicate:requiresInteractionState> <urn:usf:interaction-state:empty> <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
