<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:progressive-disclosure:1> <urn:usf:predicate:assistiveSemantics> "The relationship between the control and the region it governs is programmatic, and the expanded state is exposed." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:progressive-disclosure:1> <urn:usf:predicate:canonicalName> "progressive-disclosure" <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:progressive-disclosure:1> <urn:usf:predicate:focusBehaviour> "Disclosing moves focus into the disclosed region only when the actor asked for it; collapsing returns focus to the control." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:progressive-disclosure:1> <urn:usf:predicate:keyboardBehaviour> "The disclosure control is operable by keyboard and its expanded state is conveyed, not merely drawn." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:progressive-disclosure:1> <urn:usf:predicate:patternAnatomy> "A disclosure control whose current state is evident." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:progressive-disclosure:1> <urn:usf:predicate:patternAnatomy> "A primary path that works with no secondary choice made." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:progressive-disclosure:1> <urn:usf:predicate:patternAnatomy> "The secondary choices, once disclosed." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:progressive-disclosure:1> <urn:usf:predicate:patternPurpose> "Keep a secondary set of choices available without letting it compete with the primary intent." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:progressive-disclosure:1> <urn:usf:predicate:prohibitedShortcut> "Do not disclose by removing the control that governs the disclosure." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:progressive-disclosure:1> <urn:usf:predicate:prohibitedShortcut> "Do not hide anything required to complete the primary intent." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:progressive-disclosure:1> <urn:usf:predicate:requiresInteractionState> <urn:usf:interaction-state:empty> <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:progressive-disclosure:1> <urn:usf:predicate:requiresInteractionState> <urn:usf:interaction-state:ready> <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:progressive-disclosure:1> <urn:usf:predicate:responsiveBehaviour> "On a narrow viewport the secondary choices may collapse by default, and the primary path must remain complete without them." <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
<urn:usf:future-use-pattern:progressive-disclosure:1> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:FutureUsePattern> <urn:usf:graph:future-use-patterns> .
